      "question": "Does frozen report silently recompute live money?",
      "conclusion": "No in inspected projection. Close87 gets same BusinessDayReconciliationDto live report service and100 serializes with defaultJSON; DTO retains rawJSON. Client125-126 deserializes same shared DTO defaultJSON and XAML labels read-only frozen snapshot. Reload fetches snapshot only forClosed; reopened UI hides it while history/pointer remains in storage. No roundtrip/UIexecution performed."
    },
    {
      "question": "Does normal live/frozen JSON casing differ?",
      "conclusion": "No source mismatch established: embedded JSON written/read defaultserializer with sharedApplicationDTO; outerHTTPserialization does not itself reinterpret embeddedstring. Future DTOversion/corruptJSON and repeatedgetterparsing remain test/design limitations, not current proved defect."
    },
    {
      "question": "Do financial read permissions match?",
      "conclusion": "Not at inspected boundaries. LiveVM19-32 checksreports_view, liveendpoint2013-2018 invokes helper2282-2289. Frozenroutes421-428 directlyquery, clientload125-135 andXAML102-130 do not applysameguard. Sharedmiddleware requiresvalidsession, not reportspermission. No anonymous/userdata/APIrequest executed."
